The class also provides an option to save intermediate results into a database for future reference. This can be useful for tracking the progress of the disjointness check during long computations or debugging purposes.

The `getNumDisjointPairs()` method returns the number of disjoint pairs found in the array, and the `getMaxTimeTaken()` method returns the maximum time taken for any single disjointness check during the entire process (in milliseconds).

