The function also handles external dependencies for CRCFLAG generation by ensuring compatibility with various radio firmware versions. In this example, the CRCFLAG value is randomly set between 0 and 1 using the `rand()` function, which returns a pseudorandom integer between 0 and RAND_MAX.

