The class includes a private field for storing the range limits and distribution metadata, methods for generating random integers and floats within the specified range, an overridden `ToString` method to display the current range, distribution type, and any relevant parameters, and proper documentation and comments to explain each part of the implementation, especially focusing on the thread-safe mechanisms to handle concurrent access without compromising the quality of randomness.

