The `optimizeRandomString()` function is used to generate a random string of a specified length using a given set of characters. This function can be useful in situations where you want to use a specific character set for generating passwords.

The `hashPassword()` function is used to hash the password and make it more secure. This function can be useful in situations where you want to store passwords in a database or in a file.

