The `ExecuteSelectQuery` method takes an array of command line arguments for a SELECT query, constructs a parameterized SQL command from the values in the array, opens a connection to the database using the `SqlConnection` class, and executes the command using the `SqlCommand` class. The results are then read using the `ExecuteReaderAsync` method and printed to the console.

