The `dataCollector` function uses an external storage system to save the collected data points periodically. The function also includes logging capabilities for debugging and monitoring purposes.

The code defines a `ExternalStorageSystem` class that provides a wrapper around the external storage system instance, allowing the function to call its methods asynchronously and handle errors gracefully.

