The service defines two endpoints: `/hash`, which generates a new MD5 hash for a user-provided string, and `/verify`, which verifies whether a given string matches an expected hash value. The `/hash` endpoint supports both GET and POST methods for hashing strings, while the `/verify` endpoint only supports POST.

