The `create_crc_indications` function creates a linked list of `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_NODE` structures, each containing a pointer to an instance of `NFAPI_CRC_INDICATION_PDU`. The `insert_crc_indication` function inserts a new node into the linked list.

