The `main` method starts by creating an instance of the `GraphDatabase` class and calling its `run` method, which initializes the database and runs the scaling algorithm until a stopping criterion is reached. The `scaleUp` and `scaleDown` methods are called repeatedly to adjust the number of vertices in the graph based on the current load and predictions from the machine learning model.

