### Deployment Strategy

To deploy this service, we will use Docker and Kubernetes. We will create a Docker image of the service and push it to a container registry such as Docker Hub or Google Container Registry. We will then create a Kubernetes deployment and service to run the service in a cluster.

Here is an example of how the deployment might look:
```yaml
